#include "ontology.eflint".

Fact recognizes   Identified by parent * child
Fact birth-parent Identified by parent * child 

Act permits-recognition 
  Actor person1
  Recipient person2
  Related to child When person1 != person2
  Creates permission-to-recognize(parent = person2)
  Holds when birth-parent(person1, child)

Act recognize 
  Actor parent
  Recipient child
  Creates recognizes()
  Holds when Not(Exists parent: recognizes())
          && permission-to-recognize()

Fact permission-to-recognize Identified by parent * child
